11
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.960
Applying AI native engineering in brownfield code bases.

12
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.920
Developers send more time deciphering the code and fixing bugs

13
00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.680
and resolving issues than implementing new features and improvements.

14
00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:47.400
