00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.600
So that could be directly it could be the anthropic API,

99
00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:23.240
but you could be hosting your own.

100
00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:26.440
You could be using a third party which reached between them.

101
00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:27.960
And then you've got your model.

102
00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:31.040
So really your black box is made up of three things that you don't understand.

103
00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:31.800
It's called Claude Code.

